& [IR4FinalSliceSurfaceV1] is the executable slice surface for IR4 LangGraph proof runtime planning
  + [chunk_ref] is IR4 LangGraph proof runtime implementation
  + [chunk_boundary] is runtime boundary import, graph implementation contract, checkpoint and SOP-first interrupt policy, runtime graph fixtures, implementation plan, activation pack, and completion review
  + [accepted_boundary_input] is docs/planning/FSC3_Runtime_Graph_Proof_Pack.v1.sop
  + [accepted_boundary_input] is docs/planning/IR3_Operator_Harness_Implementation_Proof_Pack.v1.sop
  + [accepted_boundary_input] is docs/reviews/IR3_Implementation_Completion_Review.v1.sop
