  + [current_ready_slice] is IR4-S01
  + [gated_slice_set] is IR4-S02, IR4-S03, IR4-S04, IR4-S05, and IR4-S06
  + [safety_limit] is no live operations control authorized

  = must: execute IR4-S01 before creating graph implementation contracts, checkpoint policy, fixtures, implementation activation plans, dependency changes, executable LangGraph code, or generated runtime outputs
  = must: run completed-work review after each IR4 slice
  = must: stale downstream slices when an upstream output changes or contradicts current assumptions
  = must: reject any output that promotes LangGraph checkpoints, graph state, generated traces, generated reports, surface projections, or fixture outputs to source authority

